<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
    <head>
        <%- include('../partials/head') %>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="container business">
            <header><%- include('../partials/header', { htmlExt: htmlExt }) %></header>
            <div class="spacer_top_visual business_2">
                <h1 class="h1">
                    business
                    <p class="subtitle">We are talking about trust, creativity, and innovation through technology.</p>
                </h1>
                <div class="visual_gradient">
                    <h2 class="h2">Product</h2>
                </div>
            </div>
            <main>
                <!-- 컨텐츠 영역 -->
                <p class="subtxt">
                    All4Frame 도입으로 단일 개발툴을 사용하여 다양한 Front-End 기술 및 JAVA 기반 Back-End 개발표준을
                    달성가능 하며, <br />
                    자사 호환 제품인 All4DevOps 연계 시 All4DevOps 방법론에 의거한 FP, SR 요구사항 구현/테스트/배포
                    프로세스로 안정적인 서비스 운영을 보장합니다.
                </p>
                <section class="product_set fullback">
                    <h3 class="h3 tac">All4Frame Lineup</h3>
                    <ul class="image">
                        <li>
                            <span>All4Frame</span>
                            <p>Generator GUI</p>
                            <dl>
                                <dt>RestController Generator</dt>
                                <dd>Repository Generator</dd>
                                <dd>DTO Generator</dd>
                                <dd>Widget Generator</dd>
                            </dl>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>All4Frame</span>
                            <p>Web Admin Console</p>
                            <dl>
                                <dt>Authorization Management</dt>
                                <dd>Batch Service Management</dd>
                                <dd>Online Service Management</dd>
                                <dd>Monitoring</dd>
                            </dl>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>All4Frame</dt>
                            <p>MSA</p>
                            <dl>
                                <dt>API GW</dt>
                                <dd>Distributed Transaction<br>Management</dd>
                            </dl>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <ul class="graphic_txt">
                        <li>
                            <span>BASIC</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>Standard</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>Enterprise</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <img src="<%= basePath %>/images/business/product_image.png" alt="All4Frame" />
                </section>

                <section class="product_function">
                    <h3 class="h3 tac">All4Frame 제품별 제공기능</h3>
                    <table>
                        <tr>
                            <th></th>
                            <th>Basic</th>
                            <th>Standard</th>
                            <th>Enterprise</th>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>표준 IDE 제공</td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>API 문서 자동화</td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Controller, DTO, Repository, Batch 소스코드 자동생성</td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>서버기반 용어관리, 다국어관리</td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>서버기반 개발자 권한제어</td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>서버기반 코드생성 템플릿 관리</td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>배치 스케줄러 / 배치제어/ 배치유량제어</td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>온라인 서비스제어</td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>분산트랙잭션 처리 지원</td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td><span></span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>브라우져 기반 IDE</td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td></td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </section>

                <section class="products box-list-area">
                    <div class="generator">
                        <div class="title_box">
                            <h3 class="h3 fc-primary">RestController Generator</h3>
                            <span>All4Frame IDE RestController Generator Plug-In</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <img src="<%= basePath %>/images/business/product_sample01.png" alt="RestController Generator" class="zoom"/>
                            </li>
                            <li class="ml-10">
                                <dl>
                                    <dd>GUI 기반 Restful API 생성 지원</dd>
                                    <dd>API 문서 자동 생성 지원</dd>
                                    <dd>표준화된 Restful API 규격 제공</dd>
                                    <dd>Header, Body, Query Param, URL Path 편집기능</dd>
                                </dl>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dto">
                        <div class="title_box">
                            <h3 class="h3 fc-primary">DTO Generator</h3>
                            <span>All4Frame IDE DTO Generator Plug-In</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul>  
                            <li class="ml-3">
                                <dl>
                                    <dd>GUI 기반 DTO (DataTransterObject) 생성 지원</dd>
                                    <dd>Json, XML, FixedLength, Serializable 전문 생성 지원</dd>
                                    <dd>보안컬럼 지정 기능 제공</dd>
                                    <dd>마스킹컬럼 지정 기능 제공</dd>
                                    <dd>API 문서 Schema 지원</dd>
                                </dl>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <img src="<%= basePath %>/images/business/product_sample02.png" alt="DTO Generator" class="zoom"/>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="repository">
                        <div class="title_box">
                            <h3 class="h3 fc-primary">Repository Generator</h3>
                            <span>All4Frame IDE Repository Generator Plug-In</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <img src="<%= basePath %>/images/business/product_sample03.png" alt="Repository Generator" class="zoom"/>
                            </li>
                            <li class="ml-10">
                                <dl>
                                    <dd>GUI 기반 DAO (DataAccessObject) 생성 지원</dd>
                                    <dd>Multi DataSource 선택 기능 제공</dd>
                                    <dd>OOME 메모리 누수 방지를 위한 제어기능 제공</dd>
                                    <dd>CRUD SQL 자동 생성 기능 제공</dd>
                                    <dd>Paging, Audit 처리 기능 제공</dd>
                                </dl>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="security">
                        <div class="title_box">
                            <h3 class="h3 fc-primary">Security</h3>
                            <span>All4Frame IDE DTO Generator Plug-In</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul>       
                            <li class="ml-3">
                                <dl>
                                    <dd>LDAP, OAuth2 인증 처리 지원</dd>
                                    <dd>JWT 인증 처리 지원</dd>
                                    <dd>2FA 처리 지원 (Authy , Authenticator)</dd>
                                    <dd>Parameter Tampering 공격 방어</dd>
                                    <dd>Cross-Site Scripting 공격 방어</dd>                                    
                                </dl>
                            </li> 
                            <li>
                                <img src="<%= basePath %>/images/business/product_sample04.png" alt="security" class="zoom"/>
                            </li>                           
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- // 컨텐츠 영역 -->
            </main>
            <footer id="footer"><%- include('../partials/footer') %></footer>
        </div>
